OL,3,GNEWSAMoney from exhibition donated to
OL,4,Agoat foundation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoney raised by an art exhibition has
OL,7,Fbeen donated to help with the costs of
OL,8,F10 goats imported to introduce new
OL,9,Fbloodlines to Guernsey's goat
OL,10,Fpopulation.
OL,12,FThe Royal Golden Guernsey Goat
OL,13,FFoundation was set up as part of the
OL,14,Feffort to protect and promote the breed
OL,15,Fon its native island.
OL,17,FMore than #2,500 has been donated by
OL,18,FArt for Guernsey from the sale of
OL,19,Fartworks that featured in the
OL,20,Fgoat-themed exhibition that was held in
OL,21,Ftheir Mansell Street gallery in May.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
