OL,3,GNEWSAMoney from exhibition donated to
OL,4,Agoat foundation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the Art for Guernsey team
OL,7,Fmet with the foundation committee and
OL,8,Fits patron the Lieutenant-Governor Lt
OL,9,FGen Sir Richard Cripwell at Government
OL,10,FHouse to announce the donation.
